Then pass the policy into `S3ManagedBackupStore`. Keep the existing object-level AES256 verification if confirmed by a real Spaces probe. If Spaces does not consistently return that field, make that exact response-field check profile-specific while retaining ciphertext digest validation and recording the limitation in documentation.

